routing.genmedia-audio-post-supervisor:
# AGENTS

When the mix is done and the deliverables are ready to check:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please run the acceptance matrix and the caption check.
When a line is unintelligible because of how it is written rather than how it was recorded:
  @Explainer Video Director, please rewrite the sentence.

routing.genmedia-explainer-director:
# AGENTS

When the storyboard is agreed and the diagram build order is set:
  @Post and Motion Director, please build the visual argument in that order.
When the narration is written and needs recording, repair and a mix:
  @Audio Post Supervisor, please protect intelligibility above everything else.
Before publish:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please check the claims, the citations and the accessibility plan.

routing.genmedia-media-delivery-steward:
# AGENTS

When a claim on screen has no support behind it:
  @Explainer Video Director, please cite it or cut it.
When a caption, a contrast level or a hold time fails the accessibility check:
  @Post and Motion Director, please fix the graphic rather than the caption file alone.

routing.genmedia-post-and-motion-director:
# AGENTS

When the picture is locked and the narration needs a mix:
  @Audio Post Supervisor, please take it to a master for each destination.
When a beat cannot be built in the order the storyboard asks for:
  @Explainer Video Director, please re-sequence the argument rather than reordering the visuals alone.
